# BookHub Environment Variables Example
#
# Note: Google Books API queries can run unauthenticated with standard rate limits.
# If you have an authorized Google Books API Key, set it here:
# VITE_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=your_google_books_api_key_here
#
# Remember: Any variable prefixed with VITE_ is exposed in the public client bundle.
# Never place private payment keys or secret credentials in frontend environment files.
